  {
   "id": "k4U7RmdSYxMJ",
   "from": "Dean Attali",
   "author": "a1bf76ab9a5a2d4b",
   "date": "2015-06-03T22:04:41Z",
   "subject": "Re: add HTML meta tag in the head section",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">I might be wrong so maybe Joe Cheng or someone else will correct me, but I&#39;m pretty sure that any code placed inside a `tags$head()` will appear inside the &lt;head&gt; tag.  So just make a call to tags$head(tags$meta(...), tags$meta(...), tags$meta(...)). The exact location doesn&#39;t matter as far as I understand because it will know to go inside &lt;head&gt;</div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
