     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Dean&#39;s right. Also you don&#39;t want two separate tags for Cache-control, just one with comma-separated values (e.g. &quot;no-cache, no-store&quot;).<br></div><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"></div>"
    ],
